<title>NETHERLANDS: European feeds remain untraded on higher dollar.</title>
<headline>European feeds remain untraded on higher dollar.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European meals and feeds market remained untraded this afternoon as a higher dollar discouraged most buyers from entering the market, dealers said.</p>
<p>&quot;Mondays are usually slow. A stronger dollar and the absence of a direction from Chicago futures due to a public holiday in the U.S. kept buyers sidelined,&quot; one broker said.--KAREL LUIMES +31 20 504 5832</p>
</text>
